   "title": "About the model",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## About LongCat-Video-Avatar 1.5\n\nMeituan's audio-driven avatar model (MIT licence), built on LongCat-Video. It runs here through **kijai/ComfyUI-WanVideoWrapper**; ComfyUI has no native LongCat video nodes.\n\nIt generates **93-frame windows at 25 fps** (3.7 s). Long videos are **video continuation**: each window opens on the last 13 frames of the one before and adds 80 new frames.\n\n**No end frame.** Conditioning frames always sit at the start of a window. Return to Portrait uses the one lever there is: the position of the identity reference inside the window.\n\n**Restarts against drift.** Continuation alone drifts over long videos: small noise in the carried frames grows from chunk to chunk. So once in every 40-60 s, in the middle of a real pause in the speech, a chunk starts again from the portrait as the first one does.\n\nModel card: https://huggingface.co/meituan-longcat/LongCat-Video-Avatar-1.5"
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
