   "title": "About stage 4",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 4. Models - loaded automatically\n\nNothing to set here. Setup downloads every file on first boot (Kijai/WanVideo_comfy).\n\n- **LongCat-Avatar 1.5, BF16** (`LongCat-Avatar-15_bf16.safetensors`, 31.7 GB): full precision. LongCat only runs at bf16 base precision.\n- **DMD distill LoRA**: 8 steps, cfg 1.\n- **v1.5 Distill Sigmas** reproduces the upstream 8-step schedule. WanVideoWrapper's `longcat_distill_euler` is the v1.0 schedule.\n- **umt5-xxl** text encoder, **Wan 2.1 VAE**, **Whisper large-v3** audio encoder.\n\n**Less than 80 GB of VRAM?** Use the **FP8** version of this workflow, and/or select **Block Swap** and press Ctrl+B to enable it (20 of 48 blocks). Attention is `sdpa`; `sageattn` works if SageAttention 2 is installed (1.0.6 does not)."
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    3300,
