   },
   "title": "About stage 6",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 6. Sampling + decode\n\nFixed seed, 8 steps, cfg 1 and audio cfg 1, as upstream runs the distilled v1.5 model. Nothing to set here.\n\nOut of memory? Enable Block Swap (stage 4), or turn on `enable_vae_tiling` on the decode node."
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
  {
