   },
   "title": "About stage 7",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 7. Save + stitch\n\nEach chunk is saved to `output/longcat_longform/<name>/chunk_0000.mp4`, ... as it finishes, so you can check one early.\n\nEach file's video is saved as `output/<file name><suffix>.mp4`, stitched with your **original** audio track.\n\n**Resume:** run again; finished chunks are skipped. **Redo from a chunk:** delete that chunk's file **and every later one**, then run; each chunk continues from the one before it. **Render a finished video again:** change `name_suffix`, or delete its folder under `output/longcat_longform/`."
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
